      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this introduce a race condition? Are we assuming that the firmware will complete this task before the host could send the DAP_Connect command?\n\nIt\u0027s too bad this queue mechanism appears to cause packet/transfer boundaries to be lost, as CMSIS-DAP is definitely a protocol that operates on messages. Some useful info for recovery and alignment is gone at this layer.",
      "revId": "22ec9fc453e6a25e448fb471b44caa76151942ef",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
